<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>塔羅入門 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80/</link><description>Recent content in 塔羅入門 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>小牌數字 1 到 10 怎麼記？從開始到完成的解牌線索</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%8F%E7%89%8C%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%971%E5%88%B010%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A8%98%E5%BE%9E%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%B7%9A%E7%B4%A2/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%B0%8F%E7%89%8C%E6%95%B8%E5%AD%971%E5%88%B010%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A8%98%E5%BE%9E%E9%96%8B%E5%A7%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E7%89%8C%E7%B7%9A%E7%B4%A2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;翻到聖杯七，記一個意思；翻到寶劍七，又是另一個。這時如果有人說「先把 40 張數字牌背完」，我大概會先把牌收起來。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅宮廷牌怎麼解？侍者、騎士、皇后、國王</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AE%AE%E5%BB%B7%E7%89%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A7%A3%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%8E%8B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E5%AE%AE%E5%BB%B7%E7%89%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%A7%A3%E4%BE%8D%E8%80%85%E9%A8%8E%E5%A3%AB%E7%9A%87%E5%90%8E%E5%9C%8B%E7%8E%8B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;抽到聖杯皇后，很多人會開始在腦中點名：「媽媽？伴侶？上週安慰我的朋友？」翻牌才三秒，身邊的人已經被你排查一輪。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>塔羅牌新手入門：78 張牌到底怎麼分？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E5%85%A5%E9%96%8078%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%88%86/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E5%85%A5%E9%96%8078%E5%BC%B5%E7%89%8C%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E5%88%86/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;一副新塔羅牌拆封後，最有壓力的可能不是抽到什麼牌，而是那疊厚得像考試範圍的牌卡：&lt;strong&gt;78 張，難道要全部背起來？&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>愚者之旅是什麼？用一條故事線讀懂 22 張大牌</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%84%9A%E8%80%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%A2%9D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E7%B7%9A%E8%AE%80%E6%87%8222%E5%BC%B5%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%8C/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%84%9A%E8%80%85%E4%B9%8B%E6%97%85%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%A2%9D%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B%E7%B7%9A%E8%AE%80%E6%87%8222%E5%BC%B5%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%8C/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;假設你帶著一只小包袱出門，沒有導航，也不知道沿途會遇到誰。這是愚者牌的開場。走到旅程終點時，你已經不是出發時的你。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>權杖、聖杯、寶劍、錢幣：四牌組怎麼看？</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%AC%8A%E6%9D%96%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E5%9B%9B%E7%89%8C%E7%B5%84%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B/</link><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E6%AC%8A%E6%9D%96%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E5%9B%9B%E7%89%8C%E7%B5%84%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同事開會時說「這案子我們一定要做！」，你心裡卻想：「大家講得很熱血，預算到底在哪？」同一場會議，前一句很權杖，後一句很錢幣。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>